                                                                                
 Usage: codemonkey [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                  
                                                                                
 codemonkey — a scriptable coding-agent CLI for OpenAI-style and                
 Anthropic-style endpoints (defaults to a local llama.cpp server).              
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --version                                      Print the version and exit.   │
│ --provider                      -p      <str>  Provider for the interactive  │
│                                                session.                      │
│ --model                         -m      <str>  Model override for the        │
│                                                interactive session.          │
│ --sandbox                               <str>  Sandbox level for the session │
│                                                (read-only | workspace-write  │
│                                                | danger-full-access).        │
│ --ask-for-approval,--approval   -a      <str>  Approval policy (untrusted |  │
│                                                on-request | never).          │
│ --add-dir                       -C      <str>  Additional writable directory │
│                                                (repeatable).                 │
│ --max-turns                             <int>  Max agent turns per prompt.   │
│                                                [default: 0]                  │
│ --timeout                               <int>  Per-tool timeout seconds.     │
│                                                [default: 0]                  │
│ --ignore-user-config                           Skip                          │
│                                                ~/.codemonkey/config.yaml.    │
│ --dangerously-bypass-approval…                 Lift the sandbox and approval │
│                                                gates entirely.               │
│ --show-reasoning                               Print model reasoning blocks  │
│                                                in the REPL.                  │
│ --ephemeral                                    Do not persist this session.  │
│ --help                                         Show this message and exit.   │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ config    Print the effective merged config (secrets masked).                │
│ review    LLM review of the repo's uncommitted diff (read-only).             │
│ undo      Undo: restore the most recent checkpoint (files snapshotted        │
│           pre-mutation).                                                     │
│ models    List models exposed by a provider endpoint.                        │
│ sessions  List persisted sessions (thread id, updated time, first prompt).   │
│ exec      Non-interactive exec: run the agent once, print the final          │
│           response. Use `exec resume [--last|THREAD_ID] [PROMPT]` to         │
│           continue a session.                                                │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

